#: model:ir.model.fields,help:cgl_mrp_workorder_duration_custom.field_mrp_workcenter_productivity__duration_hours
msgid ""
"Duration in hours. The native duration field stores minutes but the Time "
"Tracking view displays it with the float_time widget, which expects hours, "
"so it misrenders (e.g. 124 minutes shown as 124:00 instead of 2:04). This "
"field converts to hours so the widget renders it correctly."
